        124.03392869747901,
        251.20796169833739,
        507.33502844537816,
        13.280104513064089
      ],
      "text": "relatively high standard errors due to the limited sample size.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/SHFDQT+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        153.18185197478994,
        277.94099643705465,
        748.223303487395,
        13.280104513064202
      ],
      "text": "Overall, we find that propensity score misspecifications can affect both the economic and",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/SHFDQT+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.03392869747901,
        304.67350771971496,
        777.1095158403363,
        13.280104513064202
      ],
      "text": "statistical conclusions about the effect of GATT/WTO membership on environmental quality.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/SHFDQT+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.03392869747901,
        331.4065302850356,
        777.5406187815125,
        13.280104513064202
      ],
      "text": "When the propensity score is correctly specified, our results suggest that GATT/WTO member-",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/SHFDQT+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
