        384.72599554631825,
        777.5410942436976,
        13.280104513064202
      ],
      "text": "tion but not in terms of rural and urban water access. We also find that GATT/WTO member-",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/SHFDQT+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
