        777.1084236554622,
        13.280055819477525
      ],
      "text": "ship is associated with higher deforestation, though the statistical evidence is relatively weaker.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/SHFDQT+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.0342973529412,
        438.04549732779094,
        777.3530799579833,
        13.280067992874137
      ],
      "text": "Furthermore, our results uncover interesting heterogeneity, as the aforementioned results are",
